{"4083090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DUMPLing", "steam_appid": 4083090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DUMPLing is a fast-paced top-down survival shooter set in a bizzare land of rice.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083090/extras/a290f1413f96cc6f982c9c7efbba603e.avif?t=1783532100\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight off relentless waves of dumpling-like enemies as the action escalates and the screen fills with danger. Every second tests your reflexes, positioning, and decision-making as enemies grow stronger and more numerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083090/extras/9089e8e7712e71003ebf3fa85b6773c4.avif?t=1783532100\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Master fluid movement and responsive combat to stay alive. Stack wild and unexpected upgrade combinations to create powerful builds, break the game in your favor, and survive just one more run in a world where food, friendship, and survival collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083090/extras/b421381d8b6017d6cb8a161e74bf68ad.avif?t=1783532100\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DUMPLing is a fast-paced top-down survival shooter set in a bizzare land of rice.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083090/extras/a290f1413f96cc6f982c9c7efbba603e.avif?t=1783532100\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight off relentless waves of dumpling-like enemies as the action escalates and the screen fills with danger. Every second tests your reflexes, positioning, and decision-making as enemies grow stronger and more numerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083090/extras/9089e8e7712e71003ebf3fa85b6773c4.avif?t=1783532100\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Master fluid movement and responsive combat to stay alive. Stack wild and unexpected upgrade combinations to create powerful builds, break the game in your favor, and survive just one more run in a world where food, friendship, and survival collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083090/extras/b421381d8b6017d6cb8a161e74bf68ad.avif?t=1783532100\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "DUMPLing is a fast-paced top-down survival shooter where you battle infinite waves of dumpling-like enemies inside a giant arena. Master fluid combat, survive escalating chaos, and create crazy upgrade combinations to last just one more run.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps